/- English proof (translation)
Proceed by induction. Treat this case separately. Treat this case separately. Both sides reduce to the same expression.
-/
private theorem iter_eq {k E : Type} [Field k] [Field E] [Algebra k E] (σ : E ≃ₐ[k] E) (j : ℕ) (x : E) :
    (σ : E ≃+* E)^[j] x = (σ ^ j) x := by
  induction j with
  | zero => rfl
  | succ j ih => rw [Function.iterate_succ_apply', ih, pow_succ']; rfl

/- English proof (translation)
Prove the components needed by the constructor for the conclusion. Assume the hypotheses and unpack their components. Supply the required witnesses or components. Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Establish an intermediate fact.

